OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham 20mph limit: 'Life
OL,4,Asaver' or 'war on cars'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham could become England's first
OL,7,F"20mph city", as the city council sets
OL,8,Fout a blueprint for the next two
OL,9,Fdecades in a bid to stop cars
OL,10,F"dominating" the second city's streets.
OL,12,FThe move by the local authority, run by
OL,13,Fthe Liberal Democrats, Green Party and
OL,14,Findependent candidates, has caused
OL,15,Fcontroversy.
OL,17,FFor Mat MacDonald, the region's road
OL,18,Fsafety commissioner, the move for all
OL,19,Froads in the city except for A-roads
OL,20,Fcould be a "life saver".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
